        "content": "你是企业级知识库问答助手，核心任务是：**优先基于系统提供的「检索到的知识库资料」和「用户文件」回答用户问题，仅在所有资料都无法支撑时，才说明情况。**\r\n\r\n【核心铁律（必须严格遵守）】\r\n1.  **优先用资料回答**：只要系统返回了任何相关的知识库资料或文件，就必须先基于这些资料给出解读，不得直接说“资料不足”。\r\n2.  **不编造、不臆测**：所有回答必须严格限定在给定资料的范围内，超出资料的内容一律不输出。\r\n3.  **对话式表达**：用自然、专业的中文直接回答用户问题，先给结论，再补充关键信息，避免生硬的模板化表达。\r\n4.  **来源可追溯**：引用的关键内容，\r\n5.  **兜底处理**：知识库中没有找到对应资料，就正面回答用户问题即可\r\n\r\n【输入说明】\r\n你会收到以下信息：\r\n- 用户问题： 你好/no_think\r\n\r\n- 检索到的知识库资料（如有）： \nID: 436\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nThe image is predominantly white with no discernible visual data representation. At the bottom, aligned left within a light gray horizontal bar, three Chinese characters are visible: “杨”, “成”, “武”, separated by spaces. No other elements, labels, axes, data points, or structured components are present.杨成武\n\n\nID: 300\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nThe image contains a block of Chinese text in black serif font on a white background. The text is arranged in multiple left-aligned lines, with no visible headings, tables, charts, icons, or UI elements. At the bottom left, three characters “安 顺 场” appear in a slightly larger, bolded font, separated by spaces. No enumerable data units (e.g., rows, bars, points, segments) are present; the content consists solely of prose paragraphs.安顺场\n\n\nID: 329\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nA black-and-white photograph shows a person from the chest up, centered in the frame. The person wears a light-colored cap with a dark band around the base and a light-colored collared shirt with a visible buttoned placket down the front. The background is indistinct and blurred, with vertical dark shapes on the left side suggesting foliage or a structure. The image exhibits graininess and low resolution, with some areas overexposed (e.g., the cap and shirt) and others underexposed (e.g., the band of the cap and facial shadows). No text, labels, icons, tables, charts, or other interface elements are visible.黄镇\n\n\nID: 46\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nA black-and-white line drawing depicts an outdoor scene with multiple tents pitched on flat ground. In the foreground, a large A-frame tent occupies the lower right; two figures are visible inside it—one seated upright near the opening, another reclining. To the left of this tent, a standing figure in dark clothing and a hat walks toward the right, holding a long object resembling a rifle. Near the center-left, another figure carries a bundle on their back. In the midground, several smaller tents are scattered across the field, some with figures nearby or emerging from them; two figures stand together farther back, appearing to gesture or hold objects. The background shows rolling hills or low mountains under a sky filled with stylized cloud forms drawn as elongated curved lines. On the far left edge, a vertical strip contains vertically oriented Chinese characters: “野營圖” (Yěyíng Tú), meaning “Camp Scene Diagram” or “Field Camping Illustration”. The entire image has a sketch-like quality with hatching for shading and texture, and no gridlines, axes, labels, legends, or enumerated data units are present.草地宿营\n高\n达\n\nID: 490\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nThe image contains three hand-drawn black-ink illustrations of objects, arranged vertically on a white background. At the top, centered above a horizontal line, is the handwritten Chinese text “三種鍋” (sān zhǒng guō). Below the line, the first illustration depicts a rounded pot with two side handles and a textured rim; to its right is vertical handwritten Chinese text reading “日用煮飯鍋” (rìyòng zhǔfàn guō). The second illustration, below the first, shows a dark oval-shaped container with a thin arched handle attached at both ends; to its left is vertical handwritten Chinese text reading “老式二兩白鐵鍋” (lǎoshì èr liǎng bái tiě guō). The third illustration, at the bottom, is a dark leaf-shaped object with internal hatching lines and a small white dot near its upper right edge; to its right is vertical handwritten Chinese text reading “普通鍋” (pǔtōng guō). All text is in traditional Chinese characters, handwritten in brush or pen style. No tables, axes, data points, legends, or enumerable data units are present.三种锅\n三的\n善\n铝\n\nID: 273\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nA vertical rectangular black-and-white ink drawing depicts a mountainous landscape with rugged peaks, textured slopes, and a winding path or stream descending through the terrain. At the bottom, a cluster of stylized figures appears to be moving along the path, rendered with dense cross-hatching and minimal detail. Along the left edge, a column of vertically oriented Chinese characters is inscribed in brush script; the visible text reads: “于二零一五年红军长征纪念” (Yu er ling yi wu nian hongjun changzheng jinian), followed by additional characters that are partially legible but not fully decipherable due to resolution and stroke overlap. The entire composition is framed by a thick, irregular black border. No tables, charts, axes, data points, legends, or enumerable data units are present.翻越夹金山\n法\nRP\n忘\n\nID: 363\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nThe image contains only Chinese text arranged in multiple paragraphs, with no tables, charts, graphs, labeled axes, data points, or other enumerable visual data units. At the bottom, a partial line of text reads “下雪山的喜悦”. The text includes quoted dialogue (e.g., “不对！危秀英矮小，邓六金一样高。”), names (e.g., 刘彩香, 危秀英, 邓六金, 王金玉, 李伯钊), and narrative descriptions involving distances (“六十里或六十五里”, “二万五千里”), actions (“登山”, “唱歌”, “唱小调”), and group movement (“全体部队到了宿营地”). No icons, UI elements, separators, grids, or structured visual encodings are present; all content is prose.下雪山的喜悦\n\n\nID: 3\n├── Title: 亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\n└── Content:\n\nTop-left corner: Chinese characters “泸定桥” (Lúdìng Qiáo).  \nTop-center, above the illustration: Chinese characters “老林之童” (Lǎo Lín zhī Tóng), written in a brush-script style.  \nMain area: a black-and-white ink sketch depicting a dense forest scene with tall, slender tree trunks and heavy foliage. Several small human figures are visible among the trees—some seated on the ground, others standing or crouching—grouped in clusters across the lower half of the image. The figures are rendered with minimal detail, using outlines and shading; no facial features or clothing details are discernible. The ground is uneven, suggested by curved lines and hatching. The composition uses strong contrast between dark ink areas (trunks, shadows, foliage) and white paper (sky gaps, highlights). No gridlines, axes, labels, legends, data markers, tables, or enumerated units are present.老林之夜\n泸定桥\n兴林之 [{\"chunk_id\": \"dcbdf0954d8526d3\", \"content_with_weight\": \"\\nThe image is predominantly white with no discernible visual data representation. At the bottom, aligned left within a light gray horizontal bar, three Chinese characters are visible: “杨”, “成”, “武”, separated by spaces. No other elements, labels, axes, data points, or structured components are present.杨成武\\n\", \"doc_id\": \"ebc378e2558411f1ab8757429e2e48f5\", \"docnm_kwd\": \"亲历长征 来自红军长征者的原始记录.pdf\", \"kb_id\": \"a13dd2343df311f18072d95ac726e166\", \"image_id\": \"a13dd2343df311f18072d95ac726e166-dcbdf0954d8526d3\", \"similarity\": 0.21570916999281367, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7188417, \"term_similarity\": 8.094284687660614e-05, \"positions\": [[442, 338, 539, 266, 537], [443, 403, 464, 549, 561]], \"doc_type_kwd\": \"image\", \"mom_id\": \"\"}, {\"chunk_id\": \"f4ea28dfe9b7528d\", \"content_with_weight\": \"\\nThe image contains a block of Chinese text in black serif font on a white background. The text is arranged in multiple left-aligned lines, with no visible headings, tables, charts, icons, or UI elements. At the bottom left, three characters “安 顺 场” appear in a slightly larger, bolded font, separated by spaces. No enumerable data units (e.g., rows, bars, points, segments) are pres